---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Archieval Mariano"
  description="Archieval Mariano is a publishing and audience strategy professional based in the Philippines."
>
  <section class="wrap about">
    <div class="about__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Archieval Mariano</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="prose flow about__body">
      <p class="lede">
        I&rsquo;m a publishing and audience strategy professional based in the
        Philippines. I work on the connective tissue between what newsrooms
        publish and the readers they hope to reach.
      </p>

      <p>
        Over the past several years I&rsquo;ve worked across editorial and
        audience teams &mdash; helping publications understand their readers,
        grow their reach, and build habits of return. My interest is less in
        chasing traffic and more in the slower, more durable work of earning
        and keeping attention.
      </p>

      <h2>What I do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Audience strategy and development for editorial organizations</li>
        <li>Reader engagement, retention, and loyalty programs</li>
        <li>Editorial analytics and the sense-making around them</li>
        <li>Newsletter, distribution, and platform strategy</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Approach</h2>
      <p>
        Good audience work is editorial work. I try to keep strategy grounded in
        the newsroom&rsquo;s own voice and values rather than importing tactics
        wholesale. The goal is a relationship with readers that survives any
        single algorithm change.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you&rsquo;re working on something in this space, I&rsquo;d be glad to
        talk &mdash; you can reach me on the
        <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .about__head {
    max-width: 54rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about__head h1 {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
